    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;15.03</strong> Characteristics of metastases in the digestive tract</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Schirmacher P\r\nand \r\nWHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Digestive system tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2019. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 1). https://publications.iarc.who.int/579.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 666.25pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"888\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Anatomical site</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Relative frequency of metastasis (and autopsy frequency)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Most common primary sites</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Typical appearance</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong>Oesophagus</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">2.7% (6.1%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Breast; lung; cutaneous melanoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Submucosal nodule, can become ulcerated</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stomach</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2.6% (1.7&ndash;5.4%)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Breast; lung; oesophagus; cutaneous melanoma</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Submucosal nodule; linitis plastica appearance in lobular breast cancer</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong>Small intestine</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">~70%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Cutaneous melanoma; lung; breast; ovary; testis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Bowel wall thickening; submucosal nodule; ulcerated tumour</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Colorectum</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">5&ndash;10% (14%)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stomach; breast; cervix; lung</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Bowel wall thickening; submucosal nodule; ulcerated tumour</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong>Liver</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">70&ndash;97%<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Colorectum; breast; stomach; pancreas; melanoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Multinodular; uninodular in colorectal and kidney cancers</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Biliary tract</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Very low</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Melanoma (accounting for 50%); stomach; breast</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mainly gallbladder, polypoid, and diffuse wall infiltration</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\"><strong>Pancreas</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">4% (15%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Kidney; cutaneous melanoma; colorectum; breast; sarcomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 216.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"288\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210073324;\">Circumscribed, haemorrhagic, or cystic masses</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Varies geographically and with primary liver cancer frequency.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">References: <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{18517275;7567944;9438004;17667512;11869331;16557432;11437044;16905310}</span>.</p>",
